- [x] Preserve native and Lua-screen root reconciliation, foreign outer-wrapper
      adoption, current-generation checks, and reload-safe inert trampolines.
- [x] Dispatch consumers in deterministic private order, stop at the first
      `true`, and skip every later consumer and predecessor after handling.
