      exists.
- [x] Report protected-dispatch failure to the injected consumer owner without
      embedding UserPrompt lifecycle knowledge in the shared dispatcher. Defer
      actual prompt termination and diagnostics integration to Phases 7 and 8.
- [x] Preserve the characterized failure policy for events not owned by the
      injected consumer.
- [x] Prepare/reconcile the current map-capable input surface before prompt
      state can be published; expose a rollback-safe internal activation seam.
- [x] Update process ownership, registry order, reload cleanup, package
      inventory, diagnostics, and focused tests for the selected design.

